{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>Like the meal-offering of the morning and like its libation you shall prepare it.</b> In the section of Pinhas it is written (Numbers 29:6): ״כמנחת הבקר וכנסכו תעשה אשה״, and it says וכנסכו — 'and its libation' — because it reverts to the word הבקר; whereas here it says וכנסכה — 'and her libation' — because it reverts to the מנחה. And what it added here, לה, is a novelty, for we do not find thus in the other places. And it is possible that it alludes to the tenth measure that is exalted, and understand this."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:05:26.013601079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}